        "TileImage": "$($repository e9ba3d54-59b1-47fe-9002-ec0d5bac6336).Image",
        "Description": "Shepherd: Turns out, Hannan was already expecting us, and one of the man you killed was a CIA operative. Hannan&apos;s real operatives entered the club a few hours later and left hundreds of European bodies at the feet of an American. He was one step ahead of us.\rSoap: Our credibility died with that operative. We need proof.\rShep: Follow the shell...Adamo Campos. He supplied the assault. Take out his group, and bring back his intel from his speedboat.\rSo.: One bullet, to unleash the fury of a nation.",
